# Tom Riddle's Diary — AI assistant
#
# Without these, the diary still works via a built-in scripted fallback.
# Add an Anthropic API key to power it with Claude.
#
# NOTE: This file IS committed to git. Put your REAL key in .env.local (gitignored),
# never here. Keep this file as placeholders only.

# Your Anthropic API key (https://console.anthropic.com/). Keep it secret.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Model the diary speaks through. Defaults to claude-haiku-4-5
# (fast + inexpensive). Use claude-opus-4-8 for the most capable voice.
DIARY_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
